# Sub-Agent Orchestrator Configuration

# Path to Obsidian Second Brain directory (Optional)
# If left empty or unset, the orchestrator dynamically resolves in the following order:
#   1. SECOND_BRAIN_PATH environment variable (set here or in shell)
#   2. ~/Documents/SecondBrain (primary user Second Brain directory)
#   3. Local fallback: .second_brain/ inside workspace root (auto-bootstrapped with minimal structure)
#
# Examples:
# SECOND_BRAIN_PATH=~/Documents/SecondBrain
# SECOND_BRAIN_PATH=/custom/path/to/SecondBrain
# SECOND_BRAIN_PATH=.second_brain

SECOND_BRAIN_PATH=
